WEBVTT

00:01:59.263 --> 00:02:01.363
She fled China to Hong Kong,

00:02:01.397 --> 00:02:04.130
and when she was 22
she married my dad

00:02:04.163 --> 00:02:06.430
and they made their
life in the United States.

00:02:06.763 --> 00:02:08.863
And she continued to fight.

00:02:08.897 --> 00:02:11.563
She was persistent, fearless.

00:02:12.763 --> 00:02:14.763
She never took no for an answer.

00:02:15.163 --> 00:02:18.563
We always said that she could charm
the skin off of a snake

00:02:18.597 --> 00:02:20.663
or just whip it into a straight line.

00:02:20.697 --> 00:02:22.663
(Laughter)

00:02:22.697 --> 00:02:23.963
Growing up with our mom,

00:02:23.997 --> 00:02:27.997
she fought for my sisters and I
to get into the best classes in school,

00:02:27.997 --> 00:02:29.730
even though they were full.

00:02:29.763 --> 00:02:32.797
She fought for a prime
real estate location for my dad